            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish01, 0, "遗忘十字路", "瘟光鱼", "Plaguelight Fish", "肚子里的橙光摸上去是热的。", "The orange light in its belly feels warm.", "十字路的水最近怪怪的，有条鱼身上鼓满了橙色的泡泡，还一直冲我傻笑！我才不怕呢……我只是想把它装进罐子里放在床头。去钓上来！别碰那些泡泡，我也不知道会发生什么！", "The water in the Crossroads is acting funny! There is a fish covered in orange bubbles, grinning at me! I am not scared... I just want it in a jar beside my bed. Catch it! And do not touch the bubbles. I have no idea what they do!"),
            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish02, 0, "遗忘十字路", "格鲁兹鲀", "Gruzz Puffer", "戳一下，它会吐出一堆更小的鱼。", "Poke it and it spits out a swarm of smaller fish.", "我在湖边看见一条圆鼓鼓的鱼，背上长着翅膀，嗡嗡嗡地飞出水面又掉回去！我觉得它肚子里还藏着好多条小的。把它钓来，我想看看戳一下会怎样！", "I saw a round fish with wings buzzing out of the lake and falling back in! I bet it has lots of little fish inside. Bring it here! I want to see what happens when I poke it!"),
