            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish27, 3, "王后花园", "玛姆滚球鲀", "Marmu Rollfish", "它一直在找一个人。", "It is always looking for someone.", "有个圆滚滚的小东西在花园里滚来滚去，嘴里一直念叨\"你在哪里……\"。水里有条鱼跟它长得一模一样！抓来，我要它在我的地板上滚！", "A little round thing rolls around the Gardens muttering 'Where are you...' A fish in the water looks just like it! Catch it! I want it rolling across my floor!"),
            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish28, 4, "王国边缘", "灰烬鱼", "Ashfish", "它在下雪。不，那是灰。", "It is snowing. No, that is ash.", "王国边缘一直在下灰，下得我满头都是！连水里的鱼都是灰扑扑的！我要一条洗干净看看，它原来是什么颜色。", "Ash keeps falling at Kingdom's Edge, all over my head! Even the fish are dusty grey! Bring one here so I can wash it and see its real color."),
