            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish30, 4, "王国边缘", "左特鱼", "Zotefish", "它坚信自己是世上最强的鱼。", "It believes it is the strongest fish alive.", "有条鱼一直在水里大喊\"我是最强的\"，然后被一只小虾打晕了！我觉得我们会成为好朋友……把它带来！", "A fish kept shouting 'I am the strongest!' and then a tiny shrimp knocked it out! I think we will be great friends... Bring it here!"),
            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish31, 4, "深渊", "虚空鱼", "Voidfish", "你看着它的时候，它也在看着你。", "While you watch it, it watches you.", "世界最底下有片黑湖，那里的鱼全是黑的，只剩下一双眼睛！我晚上会做噩梦……所以我要一条放在床底下，这样就不用怕了。很合理吧？", "At the very bottom of the world is a black lake with black fish and just two eyes! They give me nightmares... So I want one under my bed. Then I will not be scared. Makes sense, right?"),
            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish32, 4, "深渊", "灯塔鱼", "Lighthousefish", "迷路的鱼会跟着它游。", "Lost fish follow its light.", "深渊的湖边有座灯塔，灯塔下面有条鱼自己也会发光！它是不是在给别的鱼指路？我要它给我指路……去哪儿？不知道！", "There is a lighthouse beside the Abyss lake, and a fish below it makes its own light! Is it guiding other fish? I want it to guide me... Where? No idea!"),
            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish33, 4, "深渊", "影子兄弟鱼", "Siblingfish", "它好像在找它的兄弟姐妹。", "It seems to be looking for its siblings.", "深渊里有好多小小的黑影子，有条鱼也学着它们拖着一串黑烟！你是从泰拉来的，应该见过更奇怪的鱼吧？反正把这条带来给我，我要给它取名字！", "The Abyss has tiny black shadows, and a fish trails black smoke just like them! You are from Terraria. Surely you have seen stranger fish? Bring this one here anyway. I want to name it!"),
