            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish35, 5, "神居", "雕像鳟", "Statue Trout", "它一动不动，像是刻在石头上的。", "It stays so still, it could be carved from stone.", "神居的池子里有条鱼一动不动，我还以为是雕像！结果我一转身它就游走了！我要把它摆在我家门口，跟真的雕像放在一起！", "A fish in Godhome's pond sat so still I thought it was a statue! Then it swam away when I turned around! I want it outside my house beside the real statues!"),
            new Entry(ItemType.HkQuestFish36, 5, "神居", "辐光鱼", "Radiant Fish", "直视它会让你头晕。", "Looking straight at it makes you dizzy.", "神居的水里有条发光的鱼，亮得我眼睛都花了！有人说它是光的孩子……我不管，抓来当我的夜灯！", "A fish in Godhome shines so brightly it dazzles my eyes! Someone said it is a child of light... Whatever! Catch it for my nightlight!"),
